  "description": "PostgreSQL SQL parser for .NET, built on libpg_query, the real PostgreSQL parser. Parse SQL to an AST, deparse and format it, fingerprint and normalize queries, split scripts, tokenize, classify statements, find the tables and columns a query uses, analyse locks, rewrite queries and parse PL/pgSQL. Native libraries included for Linux (glibc and musl), macOS and Windows on x64 and ARM64. Native AOT compatible.",
